{"id":"1dbeda9b-0fe1-808d-a449-e3bc5990fb11","title":"vw, vh, %","parentId":"1d4eda9b-0fe1-80a2-95f7-e975482b1dcd","category":"리액트","categoryId":"source:리액트","createdAt":"2025-04-20T01:18:09.386Z","updatedAt":"2025-04-20T01:41:10.875Z","markdown":"<a id=\"1dbeda9b0fe18016860dcb480c9e2a62\"></a>\n\n## <strong><code>vw</code></strong><strong>, </strong><strong><code>vh</code></strong><strong>, </strong><strong><code>%</code></strong>\n\n---\n\n> 📖 \n> \n> - <code>vw</code>&#58; <strong><u>브라우저 </u></strong><strong><u>가로</u></strong><strong><u> 길이(viewport width)</u></strong><strong>의 1/100</strong>\n> \n> - <code>vh</code>&#58; <strong><u>브라우저 </u></strong><strong><u>세로</u></strong><strong><u> 길이(viewport height)</u></strong><strong>의 1/100</strong>\n> \n> - <code>%</code>&#58; <strong><u>부모 요소의 크기</u></strong>를 기준으로한 <code>%</code> 크기\n\n<details>\n<summary>ex) <code>vw</code>, <code>vh</code></summary>\n\n> ✏️ \n> \n> - <code>1vw</code>&#58; 화면 가로 길이의 1%\n> \n> - <code>1vh</code>&#58; 화면 세로 길이의 1%\n\n> 화면 &#45; 가로&#58;<code>1920px</code>, 세로&#58;<code>1080px</code>\n\n- <code>1vw</code>&#58; 19&#46;2px\n\n- <code>1vh</code>&#58; 10&#46;8px\n\n</details>\n\n<details>\n<summary><strong>ex) </strong><strong><code>%</code></strong></summary>\n\n<a id=\"1dbeda9b0fe1806ab263c379bd4681c8\"></a>\n\n```html\n<div class=\"parent\" style=\"width: 400px; height: 300px; background: lightblue;\">\n  <div class=\"child\" style=\"width: 50%; height: 50%; background: orange;\"></div>\n</div>\n```\n\n- 부모 DOM( <code>&#46;parent</code> ) = width(가로)&#58; <code>400px</code>,  height(세로)&#58; <code>300px</code>\n\n- 자식 DOM(<code>&#46;child</code>) = <strong>width&#58; </strong><strong><code>50%,</code></strong><strong> height&#58; </strong><strong><code>50%</code></strong>\n    > <strong><code>자식 DOM 크기</code></strong><strong> </strong>=<strong> </strong><strong><code>부모 DOM 크기</code></strong><strong> </strong>x<strong> </strong><strong><code>%</code></strong>\n\n    - <code>&#46;child</code> width = 400px × 0&#46;5 = <strong><u>200px;</u></strong>\n\n    - <code>&#46;child</code> height = 300px × 0&#46;5 = <strong><u>150px</u></strong>\n\n<a id=\"1dbeda9b0fe18084b549c30ac7e580a8\"></a>\n\n<br><br>\n\n</details>\n\n> 🗒️ \n> \n> <a id=\"1dbeda9b0fe1802f83f3d6ef139187e5\"></a>\n> \n> <strong>정리</strong>\n> \n> ---\n> \n> - <code>vw/vh</code>는 <strong><u>“브라우저 창” 기준</u></strong>\n> \n> - <code>%</code>는 <strong><u>“부모 요소” 기준</u></strong>\n","path":"posts/1dbeda9b-0fe1-808d-a449-e3bc5990fb11/vw, vh, %.md","url":"https://beautiful-college-c84.notion.site/1dbeda9b0fe1808da449e3bc5990fb11","excerpt":"vw , vh , % --- 📖 - vw &58; 브라우저 가로 길이(viewport width) 의 1/100 - vh &58; 브라우저 세로 길이(viewport height) 의 1/100 - % &58; 부모 요소의 크기 를 기준으로한 % 크기 ex) vw , vh ✏️ - 1vw &58; 화면 가로 길이의 1%","cover":null,"icon":null,"order":15,"revision":"4dd609ffd6c0da51618fb9057ddbe5283d94de66fffdbef7add06225be230616","bodyLoaded":true}